# Line endings are a correctness concern in this repository, not a style one.
#
# This machine has core.autocrlf=true set system-wide, which converts LF to CRLF
# on checkout. Without the rules below, a clone on Windows produces a working
# tree where:
#
#   * config.env values become "5s\r", so time.ParseDuration fails and the pod
#     crash-loops at startup with a confusing error;
#   * the templated systemd unit ships with CRLF and systemd refuses to load it;
#   * the Alloy River config and the shell in Dockerfile RUN lines break in ways
#     that are hard to attribute.
#
# The artefacts here are consumed on Linux — inside containers, on Ubuntu hosts,
# in ubuntu-24.04 CI runners. `eol=lf` makes the checkout deterministic
# regardless of the developer's platform or their global git config.

# Default: let git detect text, and always check it out with LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# ── Explicit, for the files where CRLF is actively harmful ──────────────────
*.go        text eol=lf
go.mod      text eol=lf
go.sum      text eol=lf
*.sh        text eol=lf
Dockerfile  text eol=lf
*.yaml      text eol=lf
*.yml       text eol=lf
*.json      text eol=lf
*.tf        text eol=lf
*.hcl       text eol=lf
*.j2        text eol=lf
*.env       text eol=lf
*.ini       text eol=lf
*.cfg       text eol=lf
*.md        text eol=lf
.dockerignore   text eol=lf
.gitignore      text eol=lf
.trivyignore    text eol=lf

# ── Binary: never touched ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gz  binary
*.tar binary
*.zip binary

# ── Diff hints ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Marks the Terraform lock file as generated, so it collapses in review rather
# than burying the human-authored change beside it.
.terraform.lock.hcl linguist-generated=true
go.sum              linguist-generated=true

# Dashboards are generated-ish: large machine-shaped JSON. Still reviewed, but
# flagged so GitHub does not count them toward the language statistics.
observability/dashboards/*.json linguist-generated=true
